<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <title>MIU Theatre Club</title>
  <%- include('../partials/global_styles') %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/base.css"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/navbar.css"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/home.css"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages.css"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/forms.css"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css"/>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/navbar') %>
<%- include('../partials/mobile-menu') %>
<%- include('../partials/toast') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">About Us</span>
    <h1>The Story Behind the <em>Curtain</em></h1>
    <p>For over eight years, the MIU Theatre Club has been bringing stories to life — one performance at a time.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="stats-band">
  <div class="container stats-grid">
    <div class="stat-item"><strong>120+</strong><span>Active Members</span></div>
    <div class="stat-item"><strong>15+</strong><span>Productions</span></div>
    <div class="stat-item"><strong>8+</strong><span>Years</span></div>
    <div class="stat-item"><strong>50+</strong><span>Workshops</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container mission-grid">
    <div class="mission-text">
      <span class="section-tag">Our Mission</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">More Than a Club — A Community</h2>
      <p>The MIU Theatre Club exists to nurture artistic talent, build confidence, and create a space where students can express themselves freely through the performing arts.</p>
      <p>We believe theatre is not just entertainment — it's about empathy, communication, and human connection. Every member becomes part of a family.</p>
      <p>From beginner workshops to full-scale productions, we give every student the opportunity to discover their potential.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mission-quote">
      <blockquote>"All the world's a stage, and all the men and women merely players."</blockquote>
      <cite>— William Shakespeare</cite>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-off">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">What We Stand For</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Core Values</h2>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card"><span>🎭</span><h3>Creativity</h3><p>Bold choices and artistic exploration in every production.</p></div>
      <div class="value-card"><span>🤝</span><h3>Community</h3><p>We build bonds that go beyond the stage — a true MIU family.</p></div>
      <div class="value-card"><span>📚</span><h3>Discipline</h3><p>Great performances come from hard work and commitment.</p></div>
      <div class="value-card"><span>🌱</span><h3>Growth</h3><p>We help every member grow — from first-timer to seasoned performer.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dark-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">Our Journey</span>
    <h2 class="section-title white">A History of Performance</h2>
    <p class="section-sub light">From a small idea to a fully established university club.</p>
    <div class="history-timeline">
      <div class="history-item"><div class="h-dot"></div><div class="h-year">2016</div><div class="h-body"><h3>The Beginning</h3><p>A small group gathered with one dream — to create a theatre community at MIU.</p></div></div>
      <div class="history-item"><div class="h-dot"></div><div class="h-year">2017</div><div class="h-body"><h3>First Official Workshop</h3><p>We hosted our first public acting workshop, drawing over 30 students.</p></div></div>
      <div class="history-item"><div class="h-dot"></div><div class="h-year">2018</div><div class="h-body"><h3>First Major Production</h3><p>Our debut full-scale production performed to a sold-out university audience.</p></div></div>
      <div class="history-item"><div class="h-dot"></div><div class="h-year">2020</div><div class="h-body"><h3>Going Digital</h3><p>We launched online rehearsals and virtual workshops to keep the community alive.</p></div></div>
      <div class="history-item"><div class="h-dot"></div><div class="h-year">2022</div><div class="h-body"><h3>Back on Stage</h3><p>A powerful comeback production with our largest cast yet.</p></div></div>
      <div class="history-item"><div class="h-dot"></div><div class="h-year">2025</div><div class="h-body"><h3>120+ Members & Growing</h3><p>Today MIU Theatre Club is one of the most active student organizations at the university.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">The People</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Meet the Team</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">The dedicated students who keep the club running on and off the stage.</p>
    <div class="team-grid">
      <div class="team-card"><div class="team-avatar">🎭</div><h4>Club President</h4><span class="role">Leadership</span></div>
      <div class="team-card"><div class="team-avatar">🎬</div><h4>Director</h4><span class="role">Productions</span></div>
      <div class="team-card"><div class="team-avatar">📋</div><h4>Head of Scripts</h4><span class="role">Script Review</span></div>
      <div class="team-card"><div class="team-avatar">🛠</div><h4>Workshops Lead</h4><span class="role">Training</span></div>
      <div class="team-card"><div class="team-avatar">📸</div><h4>Media Team</h4><span class="role">Content & Social</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
<script src="/js/web.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
